{"target": "html", "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Log in to Nimbus</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0f172a] font-sans antialiased m-0 p-0 text-slate-100\">\n    <div class=\"flex w-full h-screen overflow-hidden\">\n        <!-- Left Testimonial Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-[41%] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#312e81] to-[#0f172a] flex flex-col justify-between p-12 text-white relative border-r border-slate-800\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-white/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-4 bg-indigo-400 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Nimbus</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Testimonial Content -->\n            <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                <blockquote class=\"text-3xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight mb-4 text-slate-100\">\n                    &ldquo;We stopped losing tasks in Slack threads the week we moved to Nimbus.&rdquo;\n                </blockquote>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 font-normal\">Priya Raman, Engineering Lead at Fernway</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Login Form Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-[59%] h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[#0b0f19]\">\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-[400px] px-6\">\n                <!-- Heading -->\n                <div class=\"mb-8\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 tracking-tight mb-2\">Log in to Nimbus</h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">Welcome back. Pick up where your team left off.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Form -->\n                <form class=\"space-y-4\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault();\">\n                    <div>\n                        <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1.5\">Work email</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm bg-[#1e293b] border border-slate-700 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-transparent placeholder:text-slate-500 text-slate-100\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-1.5\">Password</label>\n                        <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm bg-[#1e293b] border border-slate-700 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-transparent placeholder:text-slate-500 text-slate-100\">\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs py-1\">\n                        <label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\">\n                            <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded border-slate-700 bg-slate-800 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500\">\n                            <span class=\"text-slate-400\">Remember me</span>\n                        </label>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 font-medium\">Forgot password?</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-2.5 px-4 bg-[#6366f1] hover:bg-[#5851df] text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-sm\">\n                        Log in\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n\n                <!-- Divider -->\n                <div class=\"relative flex py-5 items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-slate-800\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"flex-shrink mx-4 text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase\">or</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-slate-800\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Google Login -->\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full py-2.5 px-4 bg-[#1e293b] hover:bg-[#334155] border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                        <path fill=\"#4285F4\" d=\"M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z\"/>\n                        <path fill=\"#34A853\" d=\"M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z\"/>\n                        <path fill=\"#FBBC05\" d=\"M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.06H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.94l2.85-2.22.81-.63z\"/>\n                        <path fill=\"#EA4335\" d=\"M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.06l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.52 6.16-4.52z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                    Continue with Google\n                </button>\n\n                <!-- Footer Link -->\n                <p class=\"text-center text-xs text-slate-400 mt-8\">\n                    New to Nimbus? <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 font-medium\">Create an account</a>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>", "notes": ["Switched the entire layout to a cohesive dark mode theme using Tailwind's slate color palette.", "Adjusted input backgrounds, borders, and text colors to ensure high contrast and accessibility.", "Maintained exact typography, spacing, and component structure from the original design."], "source": "ai", "provider": {"name": "google-gemini", "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"}, "change": "Switch the whole page to a dark theme", "size": {"width": 1280, "height": 800}}